      "Prop density follows function: cargo near logistics, tanks near refinery, defenses around military frontage, civic furniture near public access.",
      "Roads, doors, loading bays, stairs, rails, vehicles, and windows remain consistent with 1.8 m personnel, 8 m light vehicle, and 15 m superheavy references.",
      "No unsupported floating masses, buried entrances, intersecting towers, curb-blocked roads, disconnected pipes, or random decorative greeble clouds.",
      "Faction binding changes material, secondary profile, signs, and selected silhouette parts; a color-only swap does not satisfy faction-specific model coverage.",
      "Planet binding changes terrain contact, weathering, drainage, foundation, and environmental protection; a global tint does not satisfy regional coverage.",
      "Infestation grows as clustered overlays from authored infestation sockets and preserves the readable host-site function until the consumed state.",
      "Damage exposes plausible structure and deposits bounded static rubble; it does not scatter unrelated cubes or seal all tactical routes."
    ],
    "rejectCodes": [
